59
00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:18.476
'When's he gonna get over you?'

60
00:06:18.477 --> 00:06:20.245
'He's such a creeper.'

61
00:06:20.246 --> 00:06:23.582
- 'He is not a creeper!'
