125
00:14:03.209 --> 00:14:05.210
God! I can't believe you invited
her to your birthday.

126
00:14:05.211 --> 00:14:06.844
No, no, no, no.
I didn't invite her.

127
00:14:06.845 --> 00:14:10.181
